riginal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MthVU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EA7E772F-BF3A-4AD9-AAB3-5A7BAA14B5D1","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"子供から臭いって言われたら辛そう・・","ts":"1624433131.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSyBl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3C7A9F6A-B29A-4F76-AAA9-4EB4DFB9DF60","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"お父さん下着臭い問題か","ts":"1624432964.047200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MODO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DC6B432E-A89D-4F29-A45A-7387968F293C","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"（汗臭い自分の洗濯物を単純に嫌がられてるだけなのか:shorts:）","ts":"1624432912.046400","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1624432961.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eij"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7918CB74-396D-4BFC-90B9-E7FBEC211D29","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"大人の洗濯が後回しにされるので、僕の下着がなくなくことが良くあります。あと、エアリズムの体積が小さいので、ぱっと見あんまり溜まってないように見えるんですよね。","ts":"1624432894.045700","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1624432927.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F7t+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1caac624-ec22-49ab-9933-d7e410d80a6c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"幼児は洗濯多くなるので。","ts":"1624432737.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F+6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6976a42d-5c57-451f-adcd-7ca8b7965779","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"汗でぐっしょりになること vs 子供の洗濯物だとまあ子供Winですかねえ","ts":"1624432648.043300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CDBp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A735E331-8995-417B-AC01-BC013B47DAEB","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そうなんだ。子供の洗濯量に比べれば大人の洗濯量は誤差みたいな感じですけどね、ウチの場合は。","ts":"1624432613.042800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zcR5i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"557313C3-9660-4651-BEB7-6248D1F16637","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"我が家は洗濯は妻持ちなのでそこら辺は不満に還元されますね。しゃーないから、ケーキでも買って機嫌を取る・・。","ts":"1624432604.042300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BHb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69AEB6C0-1717-414B-93AF-C25FC1B90F80","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"というか、筋トレしてて一番困るのが\n洗濯物が増えたことで妻から不評を買うことなんですよね。許せ妻よ。","ts":"1624432522.039900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MpY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9ce17f8-4c1c-4e17-a22b-88ddd985cecf","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"炊事選択が自分なので用事を増やすと自分が辛くなるだけというアレ。","ts":"1624432513.039800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":2,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EDDCC479-6918-4218-823E-74F30AA9F991","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"家庭を考えたエコな着回しだ・・","ts":"1624432459.038100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"epcrX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e35a506a-eaf7-4a7f-a39e-1e9aafc7e64a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕は普段Tシャツと短パンでテレワークしてて、夜になると下だけトレーニングウェアに履き替えてランニング、帰ったらそのまま洗濯機へ Go。好きなTシャツではやらないけど。","ts":"1624432403.037300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W9AV="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8f33188-ce19-4613-879e-fa5716f83462","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"漂う中部地方感","ts":"1624432264.036300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DjQg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3E7E1CBC-941D-4B66-BE1C-8BC29DB0B91A","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"だだくさなシャツ、良い名前だ・・","ts":"1624432153.035800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+uO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83b39c61-890b-4b5d-83ea-93bc16efb4b8","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"古くなった部屋着を汗かく時用にしてます。通称だだくさなシャツ","ts":"1624430955.035200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I3Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34f2cdcd-636d-4cde-bc2d-cde92c10889b","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"すぐにシャワーを浴びて、洗濯できる感じにして、Tシャツ、短パンです。","ts":"1624430675.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W7d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d52b2b17-6c93-40ab-aa91-29f88e16a180","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"適度にそのへんでルームワークなウェアとしておろすのがいいのかな","ts":"1624429619.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZbV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aafdfc6f-25f3-45b6-aead-7b1e1e6948f0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"速乾性のピチッとした服を持ってるけど汗が端から乾いてひんやりするので苦手な人は苦手かも","ts":"1624429553.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3et=c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac76929b-0484-49b4-9890-e6f953006b0a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"部屋着のまま","ts":"1624428460.031100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Efz=O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4363AF5F-44F2-4130-866C-BFE096C7DA89","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"自分はあまり気にせずやってるので普通に無地のTシャツと短パンですね。","ts":"1624428327.030600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RtLG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf86226f-3c96-4d19-91cd-ffa73b02943f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちなみになんですが、自宅での運動のとき、服装ってどうしてますか \u0026gt; any\n適切な服がないので、汗かくようなのについて、若干取り組みにくくなってて(暑ければ普通に汗はかきますが)","ts":"1624428240.029400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kgsJm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B7759C83-34ED-49B1-9A82-0D4D9DA3B021","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"久々に家でダンベル持ってスクワットしたら、足が無事に死にました。このままだと生活習慣病とかになって死にそうなので頑張ります。","ts":"1624428132.028000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AOq="}]},{"client_msg_id":"14a2fcab-dd2a-4d38-9efc-f12bd31da00f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バルクハウス、参加したいんだけど…","ts":"1624424234.026200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sipi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4595a4bc-b3da-4238-aa62-0281ef34ce48","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-xMP3xW3-I\u003e","ts":"1624424227.025800","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 山本義徳からみなさまにどうしてもお伝えしなければならないことがあります","id":1,"author_name":"山本義徳 筋トレ大学","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/c/yoshinori-yamamoto","title":"山本義徳からみなさまにどうしてもお伝えしなければならないことがあります","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-xMP3xW3-I","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9-xMP3xW3-I/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9-xMP3xW3-I?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-xMP3xW3-I","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-xMP3xW3-I"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jOI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0dbc14a-8b98-4c77-a361-a26cd7a09406","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"毎朝起きて測っています\n大体同じ時間","ts":"1624424224.025600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZflZa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a4dcdb7-bcee-4352-89d8-24687c9720ba","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"体重は泳いでサウナに入ったあとに測ってます。泳ぐ前から１キロくらい減るっぽい。","ts":"1624419075.024900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i6L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"925BA02E-17C4-4BBE-BE91-241B2328A2D7","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"体重は目安にして、見た目で判断するのがなんだかんだ一番いい気がします。シャワー前に毎日上半身を写メるとか。（モチベもあがる）","ts":"1624417613.024800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xdI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a03440f-9d09-4cd7-84e6-ab211c2770cb","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"僕が減量していた頃は毎朝一喜一憂したくなかったので週一の起き抜けに測っていましたね","ts":"1624417611.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g92Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BF397C8E-FB46-492B-8E8B-308C2E8CE9F3","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"うろ覚えですが、寝起きの決まった時間に測るのが一番良かったと思います。\n~寝起きに体重を測る気力が湧かない~","ts":"1624417518.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nBDG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA3A635A-C2AB-4E6A-876D-E007C70463FC","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"サナダムシを飼う話ですか？","ts":"1624413566.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kowawa","count":3,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U782D5DF1","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FQqy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cac3124-c70b-4b39-893d-3212e9d6e002","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":":hankey:前後で大分体重変わりますよね","ts":"1624413359.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YBWN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d20b0cd-7a00-4971-85f7-da15e1557650","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"飲む水の重さだってありますからね(出る水も)","ts":"1624411815.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IBw4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0631c03c-68e5-4e49-9ff8-4652080576b3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ごはんで増えて、:hankey:で減るので、ご飯食べて:hankey:してない時と、ご飯前で:hankey:した後だと結構差が出そう。","ts":"1624411770.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NSS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"827d5492-4a1f-49f0-80c3-472e87e947d7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"んこと朝のトイレでだいぶ変化するので測定タイミングが厳密に決めるといいはずよね","ts":"1624411572.017500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N/rQ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa0eaa35-df9d-4778-984f-06b091c1372e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"風呂で汗かくとかでも多少変わりますからねえ。朝食前、とか決めておくとよさそうです。","ts":"1624411453.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WNn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f03e6cc2-ed8a-4ded-9ff1-939fb2efb8c8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕だけかもしれんけど。","ts":"1624411368.016300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hi0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"982b10a8-ea47-4bb5-890d-b7ec48614540","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"体重、1日で1kgくらいは上下するので同じ条件で測らないとわりとずれますよね。","ts":"1624411353.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ou8EC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da00fc88-900c-4ae7-84c3-f00187442157","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あくまで瞬間の食事だからね、いいってことはない(物理レベルでない)からねえ","ts":"1624409085.014100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mnW/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6EDC7B97-BBA7-418B-AF36-A35A85981F31","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"いっぱいくっても増えないなら、食事制限しなくても良いって気持ちになってくるが、様子見中","ts":"1624409059.013600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OxmU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F0AE0FD9-2BA5-42B7-8FC7-600C5759D9E6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"増えないのは、おかしいなって気が","ts":"1624408993.012700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Un0eT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D2B1991D-7501-4A33-8C25-64B797C72E41","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"体重一時的に増えるはずなんだけど","ts":"1624408981.012200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vuPL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DDD21A66-A456-45AC-9635-E466E4B46E7F","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ピザ、チョコ、ミミガー、フルグラ\nいつもの2〜3倍くらいくってました","ts":"1624408969.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hl1d8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0ff9e3f-9d8d-4d29-abad-1051e2a7d5d0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ある一日の食事だと体重変化するかというとまたちがうし\nあと消化にエネルギーを使うもの食ったとかあるかもだしw","ts":"1624408846.010900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"66S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ee39ea8-2f38-4da7-91a6-4bb94a70c45c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、だからこそたまにのチートなんでしょうけど","ts":"1624408811.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bvwnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"353078f4-3b7d-4624-b610-4e6be2e577da","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"食べて体重も落ちる。まさにチート！","ts":"1624408810.010100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OWfj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5FB48734-0D08-4373-9937-BAD9DD67544C","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"チートデイとは","ts":"1624408772.009600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xWA4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"066DE1A8-0BC2-4872-9DD0-87E5B10D1E18","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"昨日チートデイで食いまくったのに今朝体重測ったら落ちてた","ts":"1624408767.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i/Z"}]}]
